# Graphify mandatory (orchestrator)

Full workflow: [docs/GRAPHIFY_WORKFLOW.md](../../docs/GRAPHIFY_WORKFLOW.md).

## Before any code edit session

1. Run `scripts/graphify_pre_edit.ps1` or confirm `graphify-out/graph.json` exists.
2. **Consult the graph** before locating or editing code:
   - Prefer `graphify query "<question>"` over blind repo-wide grep.
   - Or read `graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md` if it is fresh (recent build).
3. Do not start builder/investigator edit work until graph context is loaded.

## After any code edits

1. Rebuild: `graphify update .` or `scripts/graphify_rebuild.ps1` from repo root.
2. Commit updated `graphify-out/` artifacts with the code change when the team tracks graph in git.

Orchestrator owns pre-edit consult and post-edit rebuild; subagents receive graph context from the main thread.
